          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bana bataanzi babatengwana bayoosaninwa, abalo bacete bayoolala cakutayoowa. Nkabela njoojazya miyanda yako inzala, abantu bako basyeede bayoojayigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolila, O mulyango. Koomoka, O munzi. Weenzunuka, O cisi coonse ca-Filistiya. Nkaambo kulazwa busi kunyika, nkabela taakwe uutasika kuciindi ncabikilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino batumwa babamasi bayoovwiilwa nzi? Bayoovwiilwa kuti Jehova nguwakatalisya Ziyoni, nkabela mumonya mu-Ziyoni bacete babantu mobayoojana macijilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.32",
